{"name":"Whiplash","hex":"#c74547","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"whiplash","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The lash of a whip.","An injury to the upper spine connected to a violent jerk of the head in either a backward or forward or side to side direction, resembling the motion of a whip."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To jerk back and forth; to buffet.","To lash as if with a whip."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/whiplash"}],"entries":[{"title":"Whiplash (medicine)","blocks":[{"text":"Whiplash, whose formal term is whiplash associated disorders (WAD), is a range of injuries to the neck caused by or related to a sudden distortion of the neck associated with extension, although the exact injury mechanisms remain unknown. The term \"whiplash\" is a colloquialism. \"Cervical acceleration–deceleration\" (CAD) describes the mechanism of the injury, while WAD describes the subsequent injuries and symptoms."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Lateral_neck_X-ray_of_whiplash.jpg/330px-Lateral_neck_X-ray_of_whiplash.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whiplash_(medicine)","wikidata":"Q1147223"},{"title":"Whiplash (1948 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Whiplash is a 1948 American film noir directed by Lewis Seiler. It was written by Harriet Frank Jr. and Maurice Geraghty and adapted by Gordon Kahn, from a story by Kenneth Earl. The film stars Dane Clark, Alexis Smith, Zachary Scott and Eve Arden."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/19/Whiplash.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whiplash_(1948_film)","wikidata":"Q7993706"},{"title":"Whiplash (2014 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Whiplash is a 2014 American drama film written and directed by Damien Chazelle, and starring Miles Teller, J. K. Simmons, and Paul Reiser. It focuses on an ambitious music student and aspiring jazz drummer (Teller), who is pushed to his limit by his abusive instructor (Simmons)."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/01/Whiplash_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whiplash_(2014_film)","wikidata":"Q15648198"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Whiplash.png/500px-Whiplash.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Whiplash.png/500px-Whiplash.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Whiplash","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWhiplash.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Miles_Teller_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg/500px-Miles_Teller_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Miles_Teller_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg/1280px-Miles_Teller_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Miles_Teller_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg/500px-Miles_Teller_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMiles_Teller_by_Gage_Skidmore.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/JK_Simmons_2009.jpg/500px-JK_Simmons_2009.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/JK_Simmons_2009.jpg/500px-JK_Simmons_2009.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJK_Simmons_2009.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimed